==Welsh==

===Letter===
{{head|cy|letter|lower case||upper case|CH|mixed case|Ch}}

# ''[[èch]]'', the fourth letter of the Welsh alphabet, after {{m|cy|c}} and before {{m|cy|d}}

====Usage notes====
Like the other Welsh digraphs, {{m|cy|ch}} is considered a distinct letter of the Welsh alphabet for all purposes, including collation. Thus, {{m|cy|chwech}} is alphabetically sorted '''after''' {{m|cy|cyllell}}.